[0.007582, "o", "\u001b[20;34H\u001b[38;2;80;220;120;48;5;0mhrough Basrah, and the road north is held: towers\u001b[21;15Halong the waterfront, armour in the date groves, more of it coming.\u001b[22;15HNo garage until the engineers land, sir. It is you and the supertank.\u001b[23;15HWhen the guns run dry, come home: the HQ rearms you and patches you up.\u001b[26;17H\u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;255;180;40;48;5;0mObjective: \u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;226;220;204;48;5;0mDestroy every enemy tank and tower. Keep the HQ standing.\u001b[28;18H\u001b[38;2;70;110;80;48;5;0mEnter: move out    F1 in battle: controls    Esc: back to the title\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[59m\u001b[0m\u001b[?25l"]
